=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tncO_oyT8U8Q7kNvwHAHSCQ&_nc_oc=AdqM1vgr2oKXOzOyLu2ibAN7SNODBXilsMmhIisew1qxSHHdT2u9ZLj6mO63dEjhdmc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9-pcJ6f9YV4u5qBDOa3dFe9879Hyj32cbjrDeSRBt83w&oe=6A396042"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "933082209784466", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654854429_933082216451132_4347679212942506444_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xowO8OWzPIoQ7kNvwFNiPpt&_nc_oc=AdqFHEYUuUX8jvE2ZSlL85ZCSunOojdex8pOyzkm7oYsjZtIt-wYkaaEsDsUtgU8qqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Q35Q5PLTxO9TZWvv61JAGStqgv_5rcOxUhPFeX04W1Q&oe=6A3953A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Nolodin Download Manager", "keywords": ["download", "manager", "downloadmanager", "file", "browser"], "long_description": "Nolodin Download Manager is a VR-focused download manager for Meta Quest. It combines a built-in browser, a clean download queue, and practical file management tools in one interface designed for headset use.\n\nKey features:\n- Built-in browser for logging in and accessing download pages\n- Add downloads directly from links or supported browser flows\n- Resumable downloads with background transfer support\n- Live speed, progress, and remaining time indicators\n- Search, sorting, and multi-select actions in the download list\n- File manager for browsing folders and managing downloaded files\n- Download folder selection and cookie management in settings\n- English-first interface with support for additional languages\n\nThe app is built to make large downloads easier to handle in VR, with a clear interface, stable transfers, and controls that stay usable inside the headset.", "short_description": "A VR download manager for Quest with built-in browser login, resumable downloads, file management, sorting, search, and background transfer support."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": 